  "description": "<h3>usage</h3>\n<p>this plugin add a “DELETE” action in action menu after “SEARCH”</p>\n<p>it can delete the target corpse for who want loot and delete corpse one by one like some RPG’s behaviour, you kill a monster, monster drop a loot, you get loot then the monster dead body disappear</p>\n<p>i made this because i do not want too much corpses waste my RAM, and i do not want miss any loots too, loot then delete the corpse can help me do not redundant search in same corpse</p>\n<h3>compatibility</h3>\n<p>check release note for SPT version, works fine with <strong>DynamicMaps</strong> and <strong>TyrianRadar</strong>, but <strong>DynamicMaps</strong> may still shown deleted corpse</p>\n<h3>preview</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/ragnaroks/SPTCorpseCleaner/raw/main/assets/snipaste-20250306T200149Z.jpg\" alt=\"before\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/ragnaroks/SPTCorpseCleaner/raw/main/assets/snipaste-20250306T202300Z.jpg\" alt=\"before\" /></p>\n",
